+    /**
+     * Handles {@link RequiredFieldsMissingException} raised when a request omits or blanks one or
+     * more required fields. Returns a 400 Bad Request whose body carries an {@code errors} array
+     * listing the name of each offending field.
+     *
+     * @param e The {@link RequiredFieldsMissingException} to be handled
+     * @param request {@link HttpServletRequest} object referring to the current request.
+     * @return A {@link ResponseEntity} containing the error information and a 400 Bad Request status.
